<title>HUNGARY: Hungary's BUX ends officially at 6,327.12 points.</title>
<headline>Hungary's BUX ends officially at 6,327.12 points.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-06-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>The BUX index of the Budapest Stock Exchange ended officially at 6,327.12 points, up 36.77, unchanged from the preliminary figures.</p>
<p>Spot share turnover totalled 2.498 billion forints, down from 5.33 billion on Friday.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom +36 1 327-4040</p>
